# ---- a multiball of the mode's own (item 167): the framework's start-a-multiball (The Beatles 1.29
# 0x1fd310, found here by its code, 24/24 words alike): serve balls until r0 are in play, r1 0, r2 the
# ball save in ticks (62 a second), r3 0xbb as this build's own multiballs pass it, two zero words on the
